<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT SIGNS PLN 15 MLN TAIWAN DEALS.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT SIGNS PLN 15 MLN TAIWAN DEALS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel trader Stalexport SA has signed several contracts worth a total of 15 million zlotys on exporting steel to Taiwan, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Stalexport said the steel would come from its subsidiary Elstal Labedy.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
